!reports/screenshots/flashtool-*.png
!reports/screenshots/11-trust-https-webkit.png

# lab state on the host filesystem (independent of the Docker data filesystem)
.lab/

# phase-2b: release CA public certificate may be versioned once it exists (never a key)
!os/br2-external/board/hifi-bridge/keys/release-ca.pem
.keys/

